# ========================================
# IMPORTANT NOTES:
# ========================================
# ✅ .env.example IS INCLUDED (safe template)
# ❌ .env files ARE EXCLUDED (contain secrets)
# ❌ API keys, tokens, certificates ARE EXCLUDED
# ❌ Database files ARE EXCLUDED
# ✅ package-lock.json IS INCLUDED (dependency integrity)
